Modified version (AGPL-3.0 section 5(a))
----------------------------------------

Mnemos IDE is based on Warp's public repository at commit
d0f045c01bacbd845a631d07da30f277cfd2b98d ("Auto oss vs cost efficient 50/50
A/B test (#9355)", 2026-04-28). TwinCurrent ApS has modified it since 2026-04-29. Every change
relative to Warp is visible with

  git diff d0f045c01bacbd845a631d07da30f277cfd2b98d HEAD

after fetching Warp's history into a clone (git fetch
https://github.com/warpdotdev/warp.git d0f045c01bacbd845a631d07da30f277cfd2b98d). Every
file that differs from that commit has been modified by TwinCurrent ApS. Mnemos IDE is published
as a product of its own, with its own history: development before publication happened in a
private repository whose history is not published, so the public history starts with one
commit holding the whole program and shows each later change on its own. Inside files that came from Warp, our edits carry a
"Mnemos IDE:" comment (older ones "TCB:"). The main changes:

- the application, its binary, bundle id and channels renamed from Warp to
  Mnemos;
- the crates under ide/ (named tcb/ before 2026-10-08) and ide/claude-plugin
  added: projects across machines, settings and Claude Code session sync, the
  agents and sessions panels, session restore across restarts and the git
  tree panel;
- upstream server and cloud features disconnected or pointed at Mnemos's own
  server;
- changes throughout the rest of the code base.


